    "notes": "Parsed 258 rifle-bullet columns from 30 tables on PDF pages 76-98 with pdftotext version 24.02.0 (pdftotext -bbox word coordinates; columns anchored on the Item # row and verified against the -layout Item # lines; every word inside a table span assigned or the run aborts). Skipped: muzzleloader tables (PDF pp. 72-73) and handgun sections (PDF pp. 99-103: FTX® Handgun (Flex Tip eXpanding), XTP® (eXtreme Terminal Performance), FMJ Handgun (Full Metal Jacket), HAP® (Hornady Action Pistol), DGH® (Dangerous Game Handgun)). Rifle bullets in pistol diameters inside rifle sections (e.g. 350 Legend .355\", 450 Bushmaster .452\") are kept. PDF page 5 (new-products teaser) repeats items printed in the main tables and was not parsed. The catalog prints no bullet length (lengthIn null). Tables headed \"Ballistic Coef.\" (SST, InterLock, DGX Bonded, DGS, V-MAX, NTX, Traditional Varmint, Sub-X, MonoFlex, Traditional & FMJ Rifle, FTX) print one BC without naming a drag model; it is compared with / stored as G1 because hornady.com types these bullets' BC \"(G1)\" (156 of 157 matched web records; with no web BC: 1; typed otherwise: 0; web G1 equals the catalog value in 155 of 157). The Match(TM) tables print only \"G1 Ballistic Coef.\". G7 is compared only for tables with a \"G7 Ballistic Coef.\" row; a printed dash = not published (null). Evidence order: CALIBER+TYPE | Diameter | Weight | G1 | G7 | Sec. Den. | Item # (single-BC tables: CALIBER+TYPE | Diameter | Weight | Ballistic Coef. | Sec. Den. | Item #), values as printed, \"(blank)\" = empty cell. Matching: a web sku equal to any slash-separated catalog item number, else a web sku whose digits before a letter/-NN suffix equal one (7 suffix matches: 22791B->22791, 22834B->22834, 24561B->24561, 26331B->26331/263311, 26333B->26333/263331, 3031-75->3031, 30506B->30506). 255 catalog bullets matched 295 web records (rifle 295); 3 catalog bullets have no web record (in \"bullets\"). crossCheck has 47 entries (value-mismatch 9, web-missing 38): value-mismatch = both print different values; web-missing = web record null where the catalog prints a value; catalog-missing = the reverse; catalogCheck carries any failed catalog self-check for that bullet. agreements = matched catalog bullets with no disagreement on any paired web record. Catalog self-checks: printed Sec. Den. vs weight/7000/d^2 for 256 columns (2 printed blank) and G7/G1 ratio; flagged (catalog-internal inconsistencies, not parse errors - each verified against the printed page): p86 25 Cal. CX® | .257\" | 90 gr. | .273 | .246 | .195 | 254104: printed G7 0.246 / G1 0.273 = 0.901, outside the 0.499-0.513 range of every other bullet in the catalog: one of the two printed BCs is probably a misprint; do not adopt either without confirmation; p92 470 Cal. DGX® Bonded | .474\" | 500 gr. | .290 | .316 | 47474: printed Sec. Den. 0.316 does not equal weight/7000/diameter^2 = 0.3179 (diameter/weight cross-checked against the web record instead); p93 470 Cal. DGS® | .474\" | 500 gr. | .290 | .316 | 4748: printed Sec. Den. 0.316 does not equal weight/7000/diameter^2 = 0.3179 (diameter/weight cross-checked against the web record instead); p98 35 Cal. FTX® (350 Legend) | .355\" | 165 gr. | .250 | .193 | 3502: printed Sec. Den. 0.193 does not equal weight/7000/diameter^2 = 0.1870 (diameter/weight cross-checked against the web record instead). Web rifle records with no catalog item number (13; mostly ECX, absent from the 2027 catalog): 224034, 2446, 26112, 263364, 28214, 3017, 3017B, 301944, 30372, 304714, 32314, 33272, 35614. Web handgun records not compared: 70."
